comment on table public.regions is 'Yemen governorates and districts reference; region_level and stable code support cascading selectors.';
comment on table public.categories is 'Canonical category tree derived from the Yemeni honey master taxonomy.';
comment on table public.honey_taxonomy is 'Flattened product taxonomy reference; metadata preserves source-specific grades, badges, tags, forms, and components.';
